## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-idempotent write handler
exports.handler = async (evt) => {
  for (const rec of evt.Records) {
    const key = rec.partitionKey; // tenant+ts
    await dynamo.putItem({Key: key, ...rec.data}, {ConditionExpression: 'attribute_not_exists(Key)'});
